    "slug": "bypassing-anti-bot-walls-agent-commerce",
    "title": "Bypassing Anti-Bot Walls in Agent Commerce: The Headless Proxy Solution",
    "subtitle": "How to build shopping agents that bypass Cloudflare WAF, Akamai, and Imperva without expensive residential proxy rotations.",
    "date": "2026-05-28",
